    notes: >
      Machine-generated (HTR) transcriptions of ~4.8M pages of VOC records,
      accessed via the GLOBALISE Transcriptions API. Cite as: NL-HaNA, VOC,
      [inv.nr.], [scan nr.], transcription GLOBALISE project
      (https://globalise.huygens.knaw.nl/), March 2024.
